---
layout: base.njk
title: 关键指标
description: 按周记录 CoreWeave 债券收益率与 CDS、AI 借款人利差中位数、GPU 租金、英伟达库存和应收账款。单元格照抄当周简报。
permalink: /indicators/
---
{% set rows = indicators | byDate %}
{% set latest = rows | last %}

<h1>关键指标</h1>
<p class="lede">每一行对应一期简报。单元格照抄当周简报的原话，观察日以格子里写的日期为准。某一周没有新数字就留空，不要把上一行抄下来。</p>

{% if latest %}
  <section>
    <h2>最新一周 · {{ latest.date }}</h2>
    {% if latest.notes %}<p class="note">{{ latest.notes }}</p>{% endif %}
    <dl class="metrics">
      {% for field in indicatorFields %}
        <div>
          <dt>{{ field.label }}</dt>
          <dd>{{ latest[field.key] }}</dd>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </dl>
    {% set urls = latest.sources | splitUrls %}
    {% if urls.length %}
      <h3>来源</h3>
      <ul class="sources">
        {% for href in urls %}
          <li><a href="{{ href }}">{{ href }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
{% endif %}

<section>
  <h2>各周对照</h2>
  <p class="note">窄屏可以横向滑动。空单元格显示为“—”。</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="data">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>日期</th>
          {% for field in indicatorFields %}
            <th>{{ field.label }}</th>
          {% endfor %}
          <th>说明</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for row in rows %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ row.date }}</td>
            {% for field in indicatorFields %}
              <td>{{ row[field.key] }}</td>
            {% endfor %}
            <td>{{ row.notes }}</td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>
